#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:10
#, no-c-format
msgid "Launch Feedback"
msgstr "Odziv pri pokretanju"

#. Tag: author
#: index.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Lauri.Watts; &Lauri.Watts.mail;"
msgstr "&Lauri.Watts; &Lauri.Watts.mail;"

#. Tag: trans_comment
#: index.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROLES_OF_TRANSLATORS"
msgstr "ULOGE_PREVODITELJA"

#. Tag: date
#: index.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "2013-12-05"
msgstr "2013-12-05"

#. Tag: releaseinfo
#: index.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kde; 4.12"
msgstr "&kde; 4.12"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sometimes it is reassuring to know that your computer didn't just ignore "
"your command, and something is happening behind the scenes. In this module "
"you can configure visible feedback to help you know if you really hit that "
"icon or not."
msgstr ""
"Ponekad se uvjerava da Vaš kompjuter nije samo ignorisao Vašu komadnu, i "
"nešto se desilo iza scene. U ovom modulu možete podesiti vidljivi odziv da "
"Vam pomogne da znate jeste li zaista pogodili ikonu ili ne."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The traditional way to indicate that your computer is busy is to modify the "
"cursor, and you can turn this on by choosing a <guilabel>Busy Cursor</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Tradicionalni način da se prikaže da je Vaš kompjuter zauzet jeste promjena "
"izgleda kursora, i ovo možete upaliti birajući  <guilabel>Zauzeti kursor</"
"guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this option enabled, your cursor will have an icon attached to it for a "
"short time, when a new application is being launched. You can configure how "
"long this icon is displayed beside your cursor with the <guilabel>Startup "
"indication timeout:</guilabel> spinbox. The default is 10 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Ako odabere ovu opciju, kursor će kratko imati ikonicu prikačenu na njega, "
"kada se pokreće nova aplikacije. Možete podesiti koliko dugo će ta ikonica "
"biti prikazana pored vašeg kursora pomoću <guilabel>Pokazatelj vremena "
"pokretanja:</guilabel>. Zadana vrijednost je 10 sekundi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are several variations of busy cursor available, including a "
"<guilabel>Blinking Cursor</guilabel>, a <guilabel>Bouncing Cursor</guilabel> "
"or a <guilabel>Passive Busy Cursor</guilabel> icon with no animation."
msgstr ""
"Postoji više varijanti zauzetog kursora, među njima <guilabel>Trepteći "
"kursor</guilabel>,  <guilabel>Drmajući kursor</guilabel>  ili "
"<guilabel>Pasivni zauzeti kursor</guilabel> ikonica koja nema animaciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Traditional &kde; launch notification has taken another form, which you can "
"also enable and disable here. Normally when you start an application, it "
"gets an immediate entry in the taskbar, with the icon replaced by a spinning "
"hourglass to let you know something is happening. You can toggle this "
"behavior on and off with the <guilabel>Enable taskbar notification</"
"guilabel> checkbox, and when it's enabled, you can set a time in the "
"<guilabel>Startup indication timeout</guilabel> spinbox."
msgstr ""
"Tradicionalna &kde; obavijest pri pokretanju je preuzela novi oblik, koji "
"također možete omogućiti i onemogućiti ovdje. Obično kada pokrenete "
"aplikaciju, ona dobije izravan pristup u taskbaru, sa ikonicom zamijenjenom "
"pješčanim satom koji se okreće, da Vam da do znanja da se nešto dešava. "
"Možete prebacivati ovo stanje iz upaljeno u ugašeno označavajući odnosno "
"odznačavajući <guilabel>Dozvoli objavještenja u taskbaru</guilabel>, i kada "
"su dozvoljena, možete podesiti period trajanja u <guilabel>Pokazatelj "
"vremena pokretanja:</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Not all applications that you start will eventually show a window, or an "
"entry in the taskbar. Some of them, for example, are docked into the &kde; "
"system tray. Alternatively, it might be that you sent it off to a different "
"virtual desktop, and in the <guilabel>Filters</guilabel> section of the "
"<ulink url=\"help:/plasma-desktop/panel.html\"> <guilabel>Task Manager "
"Settings</guilabel></ulink> the option <guilabel>Only show tasks from the "
"current desktop</guilabel> is checked. Setting a timeout ensures that, even "
"in these cases, you can still get launch feedback, but also that it will go "
"away when the job is done."
msgstr ""
"Neće sve aplikacije koje se pokrenu pokazati svoj prozor ili pristup u "
"taskbar-u. Neke od njih, na primjer, su smještene u &kde; sistemskom uglu. "
"Alternativno, može se desiti da ste ih poslali na drugi virtualni desktop, i "
"u <guilabel>Filteri</guilabel> sekciji na <ulink url=\"help:/plasma-desktop/"
"panel.html\"> <guilabel>Upravljač postavki zadataka</guilabel></ulink> "
"opcija <guilabel>Prikaži samo zadatke sa trenutnog desktopa</guilabel> je "
"označena. Postavljajući vrijeme za prikaz radnji osigurava da ćete, čak i u "
"ovim slučajevima dobiti povratne informacije o pokretanju, ali također koja "
"će nestati kada se posao obavi."
